{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Gunblaze Epoch&quot;</strong> is a top-down roguelike shooter that incorporates elements of weak search, combat, and retreat. The game features diverse maps, weapons, and items, along with extensive meta-progression for upgrades and management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Vast and Varied World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 5 core story maps + 5 optional zones, totaling 10 unique stages for varied challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse rooms &amp; fully destructible maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/MapShow.gif?t=1750898928\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Weapon And Item Synergies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offers over 100 unique weapons and 100+ distinct items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Item Synergy System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/PropShow.gif?t=1750898928\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rogue-Lite Headquarters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansive base-building system for persistent upgrades and enhanced gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different characters also possess unique skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829150/extras/LoungeShow.gif?t=1750898928\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vast Underground World to Explore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore underground to collect coins and items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique black market for currency exchange.</p></l